sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant A as Agent
    participant B as HeurChain broker
    A->>B: GET /memory/manifest
    B-->>A: what is already stored
    A->>B: POST /session/start {agent_id}
    B-->>A: session_id
    A->>B: GET /agent/{agent_id}
    B-->>A: recent memories of this agent
    loop During work
        A->>B: POST /search {text}
        B-->>A: ranked memories
        A->>B: POST /store {text, tags, metadata.session_id}
        B-->>A: id, indexed
    end
    A->>B: POST /session/end {session_id}
    A->>B: POST /store {session summary}
    Note over A,B: The next session, or another agent,<br/>starts again from the manifest and recall.
